{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y对人物动机和前后因果的解释有所压缩，尤其S05到S06从被看见后的不安转向孤单，X交代得更清楚。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的关键词加亮、短句交替和按音乐时点出现的感受提示，让普通观众更容易在听音乐时迅速抓住每段重点，也更容易感受到情绪与音乐细节的细微变化。X的优势是人物动机交代得更充分，前后因果和心理转折衔接得更完整。综合即时观看体验，我选Y，因为它更容易让观众边听边获得具体而鲜明的感受，但人物故事的理解深度略逊于X。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "00d8e3fe-3b61-4e95-9279-ac000a5d64b5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T080345498154Z", "elapsed_seconds": 104.672, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T08:05:30.179305+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c7206d76d85bad5783aebb6d2a5b59c866341fcb62521fc3717113db5369bf0a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23